{"id": "sllama0006", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The name of a music festival held in Indio, California every year is Coachella. It ’s one of the biggest and most famous music events in the world, known for its mix of top artists across different genres like pop, rock, hip- hop, and electronic music.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0014", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There's no way to know exactly how many exits are in a pipe, because it depends on what kind of pipe you're talking about and where the pipe is used. Some pipes might have just one exit, like a drain pipe that goes from your sink to the sewer. Other pipes, especially bigger ones used for water or gas, might have multiple exit s along their length so they can connect to different parts of a building or system. So without knowing more details, we can't give an exact number.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0022", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The movie you're thinking of is probably \"J urassic Park.\" It' s not actually about a killer shark, but there's a famous scene with one. If you meant something else, maybe it was \" Jaws,\" which is the classic film about a killer great white shark. Let me know if that's right or if you were thinking of another one!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0030", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Jupiter is the planet with the most moon s in our solar system. As of now, it has around 9 5 known moons, making it the leader by a wide margin. Sa turn comes second, with about 8 3 confirmed moon s. So Ju piter definitely stands out for having the largest number of moons.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0038", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The chemical symbol for chlorine is Cl. It's a halogen element found on the periodic table, known for its greenish- yellow color in gaseous form and its strong oxid izing properties.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0046", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Amelia Earhart was the first woman to fly solo across the Atlantic Ocean. She made that historic flight in 1932, becoming a trail blazer for women in aviation.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0054", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A chair typically has four legs.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0062", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There are eight musical notes in a standard scale. They' re often called the do-re-mi scale, with notes like do, re, mi, fa, so la, ti, and do again at the end.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0070", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The gymnast who won the largest number of World Championship s is Larisa Latynina. She won nine gold medals across three different decades, making her the most decorated athlete in Olympic history and also the one with the most world championship titles overall.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
