{"id": "sllama0118", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That would be the Arctic tern. They fly from the North Pole to the South Pole and back again, which is an incredible journey of over 4 0,000 miles a year.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sllama0126", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most watched sports event in the world is usually considered to be the FIFA World Cup. It attract s massive global attention every four years, drawing billions of viewers worldwide.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
