{"id": "sllama0142", "pool": "sllama", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Mark Spitz won a total of seven Olympic medals in the 1 9 72 Munich Olympics. All seven were gold medal s, making him one of the most successful athlete s in Olympic history at that time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
